  "limitations": [
    "the actual Browser evidence uses three generated test-only IFC4 and GLB sources under SwiftShader WebGL2 and does not claim a physical GPU",
    "surface points, winding normals and triangle-barycentric locators are derived from exact display geometry and do not claim native source face identity",
    "alignment is explicit placement provenance and performs no qualified CRS or datum transformation",
    "the replay cache is revision-bound, bounded by renderer source-read limits and cleared on refresh or dispose",
    "the 0.2.0 zero-runtime-dependency package is an immutable public package-only prerelease and remains separate from the public bim-surface v0.1.0 artifact",
    "Spatial anonymously downloaded and exact-pinned the immutable public 97,623-byte artifact on macOS arm64; hosted CI did not start and adds no cross-platform consumer evidence",
    "the actual VS Code Webview entrypoint uses a local path-free .bimfed.json host bridge and remains read-only without Spatial authority",
    "no Workspace, Canonical Entity, constraint, acceptance, publish or export authority is granted"
